    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d582-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0701" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg659"/>


                <head>Mr. Stanton to Mr.
                        Chase.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">War Department,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington City, D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1863-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 20, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to enclose herewith a copy
                    of an executive order made by the President this day, and filed in this
                    department, and would request you to give such orders as may prevent the
                    prohibited clearances at New York and elsewhere.</p>
                <p>Yours, truly,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>EDWIN M. STANTON, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of
                        War.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">S. P. Chase,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the Treasury.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
